   6               /
   7               /008    WJY     06-FEB-84       DECmate I compatability
   8               /007    WCE     05-SEP-83       Added WINNIE conditional to correct load
   9               /                               problem with new WPSYSA module.
  10               /006    WCE     03-SEP-83       Change RZ IOT's to standard RX IOT's
  11               /005    WCE     20-JUL-83       Remove occurances of RETURN as an instruction
  12               /004    DFB     01-FEB-82       Reset interleave for dd to 3
  13               /003    DFB     28-JAN-82       Set interleave for dd to 2
  14               /002    DFB     14-DEC-81       Comment only for LDSTRT address
  15               /                               AFTER ANY ASSEMBLY--PLEASE NOTE FOLLOWING
  16               /                               LDSTRT should be equal to wpaddr
  17               /                               else change labels in RXPRDF.
  18               /001    DFB     10-NOV-81       INSTALL.
